+  . Fixed bug GH-20862 (null pointer dereference in
+    php_mail_detect_multiple_crlf via error_log). (jordikroon)
+  . Fixed GHSA-f6gg-rchx-xw8j (Mixed-case HTTPS and FTPS URLs can expose data
